          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; border-left: 0px; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top" colspan="2">
                        <p class="CellBodyFootnote">Refer to applicable Building Code sections for permitted projections into setback areas and ensure that a 3&#39; space is maintained between an open stairway and the property line.</p>

          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 0px; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top">
                        <p class="CellBodyFootnote">3.</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; border-left: 0px; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top" colspan="2">
                        <p class="CellBodyFootnote">Refer to applicable Building Code sections for construction less than 5&#39; from a property line.</p>

          </td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
</table>
